/E (The Sulphur Springs Trail Race \(SSTR\) and the Burlington Runners Club \(BRC\) retain all rights associated with the event, including and without limitation, the rights to organize, use, broadcast and publish the photos and videos taken during the events. These rights pertain to, without limitation; all digital content \(photo, audio, and video\) captured or produced during an event organized by BRC, regardless of the owner of the recording device. All personal information provided by the Athletes, all data recorded by spectators during the event and any other data that is made public \(including, but not limited to, the results\) may be be used by the SSTR and BRC for any reasonable purpose, in order to assess, execute or market a future BRC event.)
